# app_test is `manual` under Bazel (rule 12): the suite reads its own source
# files (product_test.go, the declaration positions the diagram points at, the
# locales) and asserts positions relative to the framework module's root, which
# a Bazel sandbox neither lays out nor reports. Its gate is `make
# test-framework` — `go test -race` in every framework module —, run by the
# `bazel` job of bazel-ci.yml and listed in scripts/ci-gates-check.sh's GATES.
